sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Candidate (Student)
    participant Cog as Cognito Hosted UI
    participant API as API Gateway (JWT authorizer)
    participant UL as Lambda createUploadUrl
    participant S3R as S3 ResumeBucket
    participant ING as Lambda ingestUpload
    participant SFN as Step Functions
    participant EX as Lambda extractText
    participant TX as Textract
    participant PS as Lambda parseScore
    participant HF as Hugging Face API
    participant DB as DynamoDB ResultsTable
    participant NOT as Lambda notifyResult
    participant SNS as Amazon SNS

    C->>Cog: Login (Hosted UI, implicit flow)
    Cog-->>C: access_token + id_token
    C->>API: POST /upload (Bearer JWT)
    API->>UL: invoke (claims validated)
    UL-->>C: presigned PUT URL + candidateId/resumeId
    C->>S3R: PUT resume.pdf (direct, via presigned URL)
    S3R-->>ING: ObjectCreated(PUT) event
    ING->>SFN: StartExecution(candidateId, resumeId, jobId)
    SFN->>EX: ExtractTextStep
    EX->>TX: DetectDocumentText
    TX-->>EX: extracted text
    SFN->>PS: ParseAndScoreStep
    PS->>HF: chat completion (resume text + job postings)
    HF-->>PS: skills, matchScore, summary (JSON)
    PS->>DB: PutItem (candidateId, resumeId, jobId, matchScore)
    SFN->>NOT: NotifyResultStep
    NOT->>SNS: Publish(candidateId, matchScore)
    C->>API: GET /results/{candidateId} (Bearer JWT, polling)
    API-->>C: match score + summary + skills
